## Purpose and audience
Purpose: Verify List iteration ordering through executable runtime oracles against the real implementation.
Audience: library and compiler engineers who run the spec suite.

## Operator workflow
Run `bin/simple test /tmp/mod13/test/unit/std/complete/list_2_complete_spec.spl` and require the final Results line to report 0 failed.

